SUMMARY:Visit & Tea Tasting at Lan Su Chinese Garden
DESCRIPTION:Visit the Lan Su Chinese Garden and stroll the beautiful grounds on Mother’s Day! You can also book an a unique tea tasting at Lan Su Chinese Garden on Mother’s Day (for an additional cost). \n~~~ \nGarden Tea Tasting with Hannah Ma \nThis spring\, take a front-row seat to Chinese tea culture with our intimate Garden Tea Tasting Series (March–May)\, led by tea master Hannah Ma. Savor three seasonal teas from Yun Shui Teahouse\, learn traditional brewing techniques\, and explore the stories behind centuries of tea culture. Your ticket includes admission to Lan Su Chinese Garden on the day of your tasting. \nAfter your 1-hour tasting\, you’ll receive a porcelain teacup to continue your journey at home. All sampled teas will also be available for purchase in our Yun Shui Teahouse. \nSeating is very limited for these intimate group tastings\, so reserve your seat early. Your ticket includes garden admission on the day of your tasting. \nLan Su Members & Guests: $36.95\nNon-Members: $55.95
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/visit-tea-tasting-at-lan-su-chinese-garden/
LOCATION:Lan Su Chinese Garden\, 239 NW Everett St\, Portland\, OR\, 97209
CATEGORIES:Mother's Day
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/lan-su-others-day-and-garden-tea-tastings.jpg
GEO:45.5255313;-122.6730382
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Lan Su Chinese Garden 239 NW Everett St Portland OR 97209;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=239 NW Everett St:geo:-122.6730382,45.5255313
END:VEVENT
