SUMMARY:Mother's Day and Cinco de Mayo Crafts at FLIP
DESCRIPTION:Through May 15th\, come and enjoy crafts for Mother’s Day and Cinco de Mayo at The FLIP Children’s Museum of Hillsboro. We’re making FLOWER SUNCATCHERS and OJO de DIOS yarn ornaments. \nWe also have a new cardboard engineering station with a CHOMPSAW. It’s super fun and safe – you have to check it out. \nAll our normal exhibits are open as well\, like our green screen stage\, cartoon-making room\, and fort-building area. Come over and play – and bring a friend! \n$10/Person\, Under Age 2 is Free \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
